<div class="bhd-page__keypoints" aria-label="Best Hydrate preparation principles">
  <div><strong>Label first</strong><span>Use the scoop quantity and directions printed on the current container.</span></div>
  <div><strong>500 mL serving</strong><span>The current public product page describes a 500 mL serving. If your physical label differs, follow the label in hand.</span></div>
  <div><strong>Do not guess stronger</strong><span>More powder does not automatically mean better hydration and changes the intended concentration.</span></div>
